warning: queue `assistants` in /var/folders/87/tdf6vfls1fj_4ydz_y6sk3580000gn/T//aion-acceptance-absent-52180.awl declares 1 environment pass-through variable(s) that are NOT set on this machine, so the agent subprocess will run without them: AION_ACCEPTANCE_UNSET_VARIABLE.
  The `env_pass` list is the agent's whole environment — this worker carries 1 of them — and an agent missing a credential or a home directory fails inside its own error message, a long way from this cause. Set them here, or drop them from the document's `harness` section.
