crates/aion-awl/tests/fixtures/rev2/harness-section/invalid/relative_norn_binary.awl:25:12: error: `binary "bin/norn"` must be an ABSOLUTE path. A worker is started from whatever directory a supervisor or a shell happens to be in, so a relative path names a different file on every launch. To take the adapter's own `norn`-on-`PATH` default instead, omit `binary` entirely.
[exit=1]

